  "label": "User projected onto the soldier in the foreground",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the soldier_in_foreground visual entity. The soldier's direct gaze and serious expression create an implicit identification with the viewer, making the user feel as if they are the one in the scene, embodying the role of the 'shooter' or the 'bomber' mentioned in the text. This projection is reinforced by the meme's dark humor and irony, which invites the user to imagine themselves in the absurd scenario described.",
